2026-10-13T10:27:48.5646015Z options:
2026-10-13T10:27:48.5646218Z   -h, --help            show this help message and exit
2026-10-13T10:27:48.5646499Z   -w WORKER_NUMBER, --worker-number WORKER_NUMBER
2026-10-13T10:27:48.5647070Z                         worker number: number of worker processes to start
