2026-10-13T10:27:48.5650463Z                         shard number: number of layers in layerwise mode; use
2026-10-13T10:27:48.5650786Z                         1 in non-layerwise mode.
2026-10-13T10:27:48.5651047Z   -b BLOCK_NUMBER, --block-number BLOCK_NUMBER
2026-10-13T10:27:48.5651308Z                         block number: total number of blocks.
2026-10-13T10:27:48.5651617Z   -d DUMP_EPOCH_NUMBER, --dump-epoch-number DUMP_EPOCH_NUMBER
2026-10-13T10:27:48.5652111Z                         dump epoch number: number of dump epochs.
